OL,3,GNEWSATiger attack park closed for third
OL,4,Aday
OL,5,
OL,6,FYorkshire Wildlife Park remains closed
OL,7,Ffor a third day as investigations
OL,8,Fcontinue into the death of a man who
OL,9,Fwas attacked by a tiger when he entered
OL,10,Fits enclosure.
OL,12,FThe park near Doncaster was closed over
OL,13,Fthe weekend after reports of a man
OL,14,Fclimbing down into the enclosure from a
OL,15,Fwalkway on Saturday afternoon.
OL,17,FAn eyewitness described seeing the man
OL,18,Fwearing headphones and "pacing around"
OL,19,Fnear the enclosure before he went in
OL,20,Fand was attacked.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
